# 🌐 Task 3 — Office Network Configuration

---

## 🇬🇧 ENGLISH

### 📝 Description
This project simulates and documents a small office network with static IP addressing, DNS configuration, shared resources, and automatic daily backups with failure/recovery simulation.

---

### 🛠️ Tools Used

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Cisco Packet Tracer | Network simulation |
| Robocopy | Automatic backups |
| Windows Task Scheduler | Backup automation |
| Cisco Packet Tracer | Network diagram |

---

### 🖥️ Network Topology

```
[PC0] ──────┐
[PC1] ──────┼──── [Switch] ──── [Server]
[PC2] ──────┘         │
                  [Printer]
```

The full simulation file is available at: `network_topology.pkt`

