---

### 💾 Backup Strategy

#### Tool: Robocopy (Windows)

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Source | Clients\PC0, Clients\PC1, Clients\PC2 |
| Destination | Backup\PC0, Backup\PC1, Backup\PC2 |
| Schedule | Every day at 08:00 |
| Log file | Backup\backup_log.txt |

#### How to run manually
```
scripts\backup.bat
```

#### Automation
```
schtasks /create /tn "DailyBackup" /tr "scripts\backup.bat" /sc daily /st 08:00 /f
```

---

### 🔥 Failure and Recovery Simulation

#### Simulate failure
```
del Clients\PC0\document1.txt
```

#### Restore from backup
```
copy Backup\PC0\document1.txt Clients\PC0\document1.txt
```

#### Result
✅ File successfully restored from backup

